  ('2ed9292d-5355-489d-a2ec-64452186f945', '<p>This is a proposed activity. Its methods, timing and location will be agreed with participating communities before anything begins.</p>', '', 'proposed', null, null, null, 1, true, 'community-bird-recording', 'Community bird recording', 'Regular, repeated counts of the birds seen at a local site, made by young people using a simple shared method.', 'Which birds use our local site, and how does that change through the year?', 'Walk or watch from the same place at the same time of day
