  ('871abfcd-59c7-477d-abec-4d255944dc25', '<p>This is a proposed activity. Its methods, timing and location will be agreed with participating communities before anything begins.</p>', '', 'proposed', null, null, null, 2, true, 'local-plant-survey', 'Local plant survey', 'Building a shared record of the trees and plants around a community, including the names and uses people know them by.', 'Which plants grow around us, what do we call them, and how are they used?', 'Mark out small survey plots or follow a fixed path
Photograph and describe each plant
