  ('f4fe8ee6-5292-4b56-a291-46ae45af33ae', '<p>This is a proposed activity. Its methods, timing and location will be agreed with participating communities before anything begins.</p>', '', 'proposed', null, null, null, 3, true, 'pollinator-watch', 'Pollinator watch', 'Timed observations of the insects visiting flowers in gardens, fields and field edges.', 'Which insects visit the flowers in our gardens and fields?', 'Choose a flowering plant and watch it for a fixed number of minutes
Count each kind of visitor: bees, butterflies, flies, beetles and others
